    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_TRANSMUTATION_CHARTER_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Transmutation Charter.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Target: a resource on a plot you own, and the resource of its group it becomes.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Strategic: Copper, Gunpowder, Horse, Iron, Mithril, Reagents.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Luxury: Cotton, Dye, Fur, Gems, Gold, Ivory, Pearls, Silk, Sugar, Whale, Wine.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Food: Banana, Clam, Corn, Cow, Crab, Deer, Fish, Pig, Rice, Sheep, Wheat.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]A water resource becomes a water resource, a land resource a land resource. Needs the tech that reveals the new resource.",
